  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving safeguards to at-risk women and women survivors of gender-based domestic violence through improved protection, access to justice and reintegration in Rasht Valley of Tajikistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall aim of the Action is to promote women&#xbf;s rights and contribute to gender equality by strengthening the self-reliance of at-risk women and women survivors of gender-based domestic violence in remote rural areas. The specific objective of the action is twofold: 1.To strengthen the protection environment for at-risk women and survivors of gender-based domestic violence in remote rural areas through improved access to justice and support services and 2: To support women affected by gender-based domestic violence to reintegrate in the society through education and social economic empowerment.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
